1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,934
Skin feeling dry and depleted, even after you moisturize?

2
00:00:03,934 --> 00:00:08,963
Today we're looking at the Dermalogica Intensive Moisture Balance: what it does,

3
00:00:08,963 --> 00:00:10,975
what's in it, and how to use it.

4
00:00:11,738 --> 00:00:15,828
Intensive Moisture Balance is an ultra-nourishing moisturizer.

5
00:00:15,828 --> 00:00:19,589
It's made to restore lipid balance to dry, depleted skin.

6
00:00:20,289 --> 00:00:25,232
It's recommended for normal to dry skin, so it's for skin that feels dry, rather

7
00:00:25,232 --> 00:00:26,777
than skin that gets oily.

8
00:00:26,777 --> 00:00:31,906
If your skin needs more comfort and nourishment, this is the type of moisturizer it

9
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:32,709
was made for.

10
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:38,805
The first key ingredient is the BioReplenish Complex, a complex of barrier lipids.

11
00:00:38,805 --> 00:00:44,206
Barrier lipids are the lipids that help skin hold on to moisture, and here they help

12
00:00:44,206 --> 00:00:47,293
restore the lipid balance of dry, depleted skin.

13
00:00:48,057 --> 00:00:51,145
Next is a prebiotic chlorella algae complex.

14
00:00:51,145 --> 00:00:55,076
Chlorella is an algae, used here as a prebiotic complex.

15
00:00:55,776 --> 00:00:59,897
There's also hyaluronic acid, the well-known hydrating ingredient.

16
00:00:59,897 --> 00:01:03,456
It works together with the barrier lipids in the formula.

17
00:01:04,156 --> 00:01:08,855
Alongside it, you'll find echinacea, centella asiatica, and aloe vera.

18
00:01:08,855 --> 00:01:11,473
These botanicals round out the formula.

19
00:01:12,173 --> 00:01:13,557
Here's how to use it.

20
00:01:13,557 --> 00:01:16,719
Start with clean skin: cleanse first, then tone.

21
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:19,618
Moisturizer is the last step of the routine.

22
00:01:20,318 --> 00:01:25,003
Then apply Intensive Moisture Balance over your face and neck, in light, upward

23
00:01:25,003 --> 00:01:25,477
strokes.

24
00:01:25,477 --> 00:01:30,222
Cover your face and neck, and use light pressure rather than rubbing it in hard.

25
00:01:30,981 --> 00:01:34,861
Use it twice a day, morning and night, after cleansing and toning.

26
00:01:34,861 --> 00:01:38,917
Using it every morning and every night keeps your routine consistent.

27
00:01:39,617 --> 00:01:44,481
It comes in four sizes: fifteen, fifty, one hundred, and one hundred and fifty

28
00:01:44,481 --> 00:01:45,230
milliliters.

29
00:01:45,992 --> 00:01:51,395
To recap: Intensive Moisture Balance brings together barrier lipids, a prebiotic

30
00:01:51,395 --> 00:01:56,663
chlorella algae complex, and hyaluronic acid, to restore lipid balance to dry,

31
00:01:56,663 --> 00:01:57,608
depleted skin.

32
00:01:57,608 --> 00:01:59,702
The link is in the description.
